# Eight rays on a group of 2: four from each worker, looking for 0, 7, 14, 21 and 5, 12, 19, 26.
# Look for: results, one item of four words a ray (its id, the node that holds it, its hops, its value).
options workers 2
tensor table u32 4 4
tensor results u32 8 4
invoke Trace.plant table on 0 2
invoke Trace.walk table results 4:u32 on 0 2
read table
read results
